# Upstream visual parity

Canonical look: https://pietroppeter.github.io/wordle-it/

- The game must **look** like that site. Open the URL when verifying appearance.
- Do not invent a new visual design for the game itself.
- Game Day, timezone, DST, leap year, and streaks use Europe/Rome calendar dates.
- Auth and persisted Plays are product surfaces (not on the live site). See `REFERENCE.md`.
